The button is between D2 and GND, and two LEDs (D13 and D12) are connected with suitable resistors. Which LED is lit while the button is NOT pressed?

```
void setup() {
  pinMode(2, INPUT_PULLUP);
  pinMode(13, OUTPUT);
  pinMode(12, OUTPUT);
}

void loop() {
  int d = digitalRead(2);
  digitalWrite(13, d);
  digitalWrite(12, 1 - d);
}
```

The button is correctly connected between D2 and GND, and the LED is on D13. Even when you do not touch the button, the LED flickers at random. Which line is wrong?

```
void setup() {
  pinMode(2, INPUT);
  pinMode(13, OUTPUT);
}

void loop() {
  digitalWrite(13, 1 - digitalRead(2));
}
```
